        <section id="similarities-and-differences"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
            <h2>Similarities and differences</h2>
              <p>There are many similarities and differences with the four methodologies.  For example, Scrum is a 'framework' of the Agile methodology so there will be many similarities between these two; however, as Agile was created to overcome the limitations and restrictions of the Waterfall methodology, there will be many differences between the Waterfall methodology and the other three.  Please see the below table.</p>

              
              
